{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Item\/isDoor","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnusto\/item\/isdoor"]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Gnusto"}],"externalID":"s:6Gnusto4ItemV6isDoorSbvp","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isDoor"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"}],"title":"isDoor","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Item"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"True if this item is a door — the front door, the trap door, the grating."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isDoor"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ContainersDoorsAndLocks"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Either the map says so, by hanging a way through on the thing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"code":"hall.north(garden, via: frontDoor)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), or the item declares ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/door","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The first covers every door a player can walk through, which is why most","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"games never declare the second.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"It answers the same for every room, which is deliberate. A rule that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wants “a door ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"here","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":"” — the one the player could walk through from where","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"they stand — wants the room’s exits, not this. What this is for is the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"question a verb asks about the thing in front of it: knocking on a door","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is a different act from knocking on a bench, wherever either is standing.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/ContainersDoorsAndLocks":{"type":"topic","kind":"article","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ContainersDoorsAndLocks","abstract":[{"text":"Hold things, open and close, lock with keys, and gate the map.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/containersdoorsandlocks","title":"Containers, Doors, and Locks"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An engine for writing interactive fiction in Swift."}],"title":"Gnusto","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto","type":"topic"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/door":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/door","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"door"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ItemTrait","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto9ItemTraitV"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The item is a door — something a verb may reasonably treat as a way through"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rather than as a thing."}],"title":"door","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/door","type":"topic"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/Item/isDoor":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Item\/isDoor","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isDoor"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"True if this item is a door — the front door, the trap door, the grating."}],"title":"isDoor","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/item\/isdoor","type":"topic"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/Item":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Item","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Item"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A thing in the world."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Item","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Item","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/item","type":"topic"}}}